    "updated_at": "2024-04-17T07:38:24Z",
    "body": "I have the exact same issue using starship 1.18.2 and bash 5.2.15. Without starship, the input lines wrap around just fine, with starship, the same screen line is looped around. Deleting back messes up the screen even further. Note that the issue only occurs via ssh connections!\r\n\r\nMy locale is set to en_US.UTF-8, and I tried with various TERM settings, including xterm, xterm-256color, tmux, and tmux-256color. Nothing helps.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if it's related, but I noticed while playing with the settings that the `right_format` setting has no visible effect.",
