    "body": "*Update:* I think I've figured this out. I don't know how or why yet, but the issue seems to be caused by the special symbol used in the “character” module. If I replace `❯` with `>` in the module settings, everything works well.\r\n\r\nNote that the same issue occurs with the continuation prompt (`∙`) as well. If I also change the continuation prompt to some non-Unicode character, that gets resolved as well.",
